@PVDKIT_PLUGIN_NAME@.pvd @PVDKIT_PLUGIN_VERSION@ (@PVDKIT_PLUGIN_ARCHITECTURE@) - @PVDKIT_PLUGIN_DESCRIPTION@

INSTALL
  Copy @PVDKIT_PLUGIN_NAME@.pvd next to 0PictureView.dll in PictureView's plugin folder and
  restart Far Manager. This build is for the @PVDKIT_PLUGIN_BITS@ Far Manager / PictureView;
  the other architecture is a separate package. The plugin registers with priority
  @PVDKIT_PLUGIN_PRIORITY@.

WHAT IS SUPPORTED
  - RPG Maker MV .rpgmvp and RPG Maker MZ .png_ encrypted PNG images.
  - PNG greyscale, RGB, palette, greyscale+alpha and RGBA sources at 1/2/4/8/16-bit source depth.
  - Sources deeper than 8 bits use BGRA64; shallower alpha is straight BGRA32 and opaque output is BGR24.
  - tRNS transparency and Adam7 interlacing.
  - Files from archives and virtual panels, supplied wholly in memory by the host.
  - Statically linked: imports KERNEL32.dll only; no runtime, WIC codec or GDI+ needed.

LIMITATIONS
  - APNG animation is not exposed: the default image is decoded as one page.
  - Gamma correction and ICC colour management are not applied.
  - Images are limited to 16384 x 16384 pixels in area (268 megapixels) and 32768 pixels per side.

AUTHOR
  @PVDKIT_PLUGIN_AUTHOR@
  @PVDKIT_PLUGIN_COPYRIGHT@

VERSION
  @PVDKIT_PLUGIN_VERSION@ (@PVDKIT_PLUGIN_COMMENTS@)

LICENCES
